  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Shortest distance between two curves occured along the common normal.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Normal to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></math> at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Normal to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Both normals are same, if</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>So, points will be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math> or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math>.</p><p>Hence, shortest distance will be&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></math>&nbsp;unit.</p>",
